{"final":true,"conversation":{"_id":"69a5c514b379a0a97bd4cda1","user":"699f4cb131d0285852ce74ee","conversationId":"187b9a54-1d47-436f-a209-4bdd49969363","__v":0,"agent_id":"google__models/gemini-2.5-flash___Google AI Assistant","createdAt":"2026-03-02T17:12:52.557Z","endpoint":"google","endpointType":"custom","expiredAt":null,"files":[],"isArchived":false,"maxContextTokens":898157,"messages":["69a5c514b379a0a97bd4cda0","69a5c517b379a0a97bd4cda2","69a64a6f734c2f84b7d27d99","69a64a71734c2f84b7d27d9a","69a64ac1734c2f84b7d27d9b","69a64b2b734c2f84b7d27d9c","69a64b2f734c2f84b7d27d9d"],"model":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","resendFiles":true,"spec":"google-assistant","tags":[],"temperature":0.7,"title":"Hello world","updatedAt":"2026-03-03T02:45:03.255Z","maxOutputTokens":2048},"title":"Hello world","requestMessage":{"messageId":"4c5ddddb-23d3-4f06-ab17-3f367b5135d2","parentMessageId":"7714108a-eafa-435e-8276-4b298682dc1f","conversationId":"187b9a54-1d47-436f-a209-4bdd49969363","sender":"User","text":"can u please tell me the weather for Lima right now ?","isCreatedByUser":true,"tokenCount":3},"responseMessage":{"messageId":"0f86708d-b0c9-46b2-ba8c-bff85c985728","conversationId":"187b9a54-1d47-436f-a209-4bdd49969363","parentMessageId":"4c5ddddb-23d3-4f06-ab17-3f367b5135d2","isCreatedByUser":false,"isEdited":false,"model":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","sender":"Gemini","promptTokens":80,"endpoint":"google","text":"","content":[{"type":"think","think":"**Defining the Goal**\n\nI've homed in on the core of the user's request: weather in Lima. I've also recognized my limitations – I can't provide real-time updates. My focus is now on crafting a suitable, albeit non-live, response based on my existing data. I'm exploring how to frame this realistically and helpfully.\n\n\n**Refining the Response**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on a response. I plan to be upfront about my inability to provide live data. The response will include specific suggestions for the user to obtain real-time Lima weather information. It’ll include direct search terms that are most effective, along with alternative methods for clarity. This will be the main response to the user.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"I cannot provide real-time weather updates as I don't have access to live internet data.\n\nHowever, you can easily find the current weather for Lima by:\n\n1.  **Searching on Google:** Just type \"weather Lima\" into your search bar.\n2.  **Using a weather app:** Most smartphones have a built-in weather app, or you can download one like AccuWeather, The Weather Channel, or Google Weather.\n3.  **Visiting a weather website:** Sites like AccuWeather.com, Weather.com, or your local news station's website will have current conditions."}],"attachments":[]}}
