 you can download one like AccuWeather, The Weather Channel, or Google Weather.\n3.  **Visiting a weather website:** Sites like AccuWeather.com, Weather.com, or your local news station's website will have current conditions."}],"conversationId":"187b9a54-1d47-436f-a209-4bdd49969363","createdAt":"2026-03-03T02:45:03.247Z","endpoint":"google","error":false,"expiredAt":null,"isCreatedByUser":false,"model":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","parentMessageId":"4c5ddddb-23d3-4f06-ab17-3f367b5135d2","sender":"Gemini","text":"","tokenCount":346,"unfinished":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T02:45:03.247Z"}],"expires":1772505981566}
