{"final":true,"conversation":{"_id":"6ab31beb9dcccbf95d0197d3","conversationId":"9f71251a-36af-43eb-92c1-55c8402671bc","user":"6ab2eb359ff69f3b8ad48e7c","__v":0,"agent_id":"google__models/gemini-2.5-flash___Google AI Assistant","createdAt":"2026-09-23T00:23:07.597Z","endpoint":"google","expiredAt":null,"files":[],"isArchived":false,"maxContextTokens":898157,"messages":["6ab31beb9dcccbf95d0197d2","6ab31beb9dcccbf95d0197d4","6ab31e4b9dcccbf95d0197d5","6ab31e4e9dcccbf95d0197d6"],"model":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","resendFiles":true,"spec":"google-assistant","tags":[],"temperature":0.7,"title":"New Chat","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T00:33:18.253Z","maxOutputTokens":2048},"title":"New Chat","requestMessage":{"messageId":"307dd868-b2e7-4085-a7b7-d5cb67381607","parentMessageId":"7ab3bf72-78eb-4f63-ad37-f20824c14b6b","conversationId":"9f71251a-36af-43eb-92c1-55c8402671bc","sender":"User","text":"heyo","isCreatedByUser":true,"tokenCount":6},"responseMessage":{"messageId":"4c43009e-1672-4e4f-803d-b9a3fa533258","conversationId":"9f71251a-36af-43eb-92c1-55c8402671bc","parentMessageId":"307dd868-b2e7-4085-a7b7-d5cb67381607","isCreatedByUser":false,"isEdited":false,"model":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","sender":"Gemini","promptTokens":19,"endpoint":"google","text":"","content":[{"type":"think","think":"**Acknowledge the Greeting**\n\nI've registered the casual greeting and have started formulating a suitable response. My initial thought is to meet the tone with a simple \"Hey!\" or similar. Further, I'm considering following up with a friendly inquiry.\n\n\n**Craft the Response**\n\nI've crafted a quick response to the greeting! My thoughts settled on \"Hey!\" as the initial acknowledgment. Next, I considered inquiries for an opening. Ultimately, I am ready to return with a friendly \"Hey!\" and a straightforward \"What's up?\" to invite further interaction.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey there! What's up? 👋"}],"attachments":[]}}
